OL,3,GNEWSAEighty tonnes of scrap metal catch
OL,4,Afire at yard                           
OL,6,FFirefighters tackled a blaze affecting 
OL,7,F80 tonnes of metal at a scrapyard.     
OL,9,FCrews spent more than three hours at   
OL,10,Fthe incident in Rectory Road, Little   
OL,11,FThurrock, Essex, on Thursday, having   
OL,12,Fbeen called shortly before 18:10 GMT.  
OL,14,FThey determined the fire was caused by 
OL,15,Fa discarded battery.                   
OL,17,F"This incident highlights how important
OL,18,Fit is to dispose of batteries properly,
OL,19,Fnot in a skip or with your general     
OL,20,Frubbish," station manager Rick Williams
OL,21,Fsaid.                                  
